WEBVTT

01:30.220 --> 01:34.970
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 31]

01:40.680 --> 01:41.430
Mr. Wu,

01:42.000 --> 01:43.430
about the official post I'm buying,

01:43.430 --> 01:45.289
I guess it should've been done...

01:45.759 --> 01:47.350
I, Wu Weishi, always keep my word

01:47.350 --> 01:48.870
when handling things.

01:49.560 --> 01:50.560
But this time,

01:51.200 --> 01:53.130
someone must have leaked the news.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.840
That Eunuch Chen from the Directorate

01:54.840 --> 01:56.150
of Imperial Supplies
turned his back on me,

01:56.150 --> 01:57.039
claiming

01:57.479 --> 02:00.280
that their Directorate is
already fully staffed.

02:01.560 --> 02:03.760
He's no more than a seal-holding eunuch
at the Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

02:03.760 --> 02:05.350
Who does he think he is?

02:06.150 --> 02:07.710
You are right, Mr. Wu.

02:15.750 --> 02:17.120
So, Mr. Wu,

02:18.400 --> 02:20.840
what about the official post I'm buying?

02:23.360 --> 02:25.760
That Chen doesn't know
what's good for him,

02:25.800 --> 02:28.120
but I still have
something else up my sleeve.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.190
At the very least,

02:29.430 --> 02:31.890
he has to show my father
some respect, right?

02:32.110 --> 02:33.800
Yes. Indeed.

02:33.840 --> 02:34.710
However,

02:36.150 --> 02:37.400
regarding the money,

02:38.150 --> 02:39.400
you need to add more.

02:45.630 --> 02:47.120
At this point,

02:48.190 --> 02:49.750
however much more is needed,

02:49.750 --> 02:51.680
please just name the price, Mr. Wu.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.280
Double.

02:55.750 --> 02:57.280
That much? Well...

02:58.870 --> 03:01.630
I'm afraid I can't
scrape that together right now.

03:01.630 --> 03:02.750
Mr. Wu, look...

03:02.800 --> 03:03.910
Mr. Tian,

03:04.360 --> 03:05.800
a post
in the Directorate of Imperial Supplies

03:05.800 --> 03:07.930
has always been highly sought-after.

03:08.360 --> 03:09.630
If you can't pay it,

03:10.560 --> 03:13.240
there are plenty of others who can.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.680
Y-Yes, Mr. Wu.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.520
However,

03:20.280 --> 03:21.750
my ink workshop has really been

03:21.750 --> 03:23.480
running low on money recently.

03:23.630 --> 03:25.910
I still have dignitaries in the Capital
to offer my tribute to.

03:25.910 --> 03:26.870
Could you please

03:27.120 --> 03:29.400
give me a little more time?

03:35.150 --> 03:36.280
Mr. Tian,

03:36.880 --> 03:38.300
given our close ties,

03:38.520 --> 03:40.720
how could I possibly turn my back on you?

03:42.190 --> 03:42.840
Come on,

03:43.470 --> 03:44.930
let me show you the way out.

03:45.079 --> 03:46.210
I'm all ears, Mr. Wu.

03:48.400 --> 03:50.290
You can make ink for foreign trade.

03:50.290 --> 03:52.840
[Unauthorized personal trade
with foreign states is]

03:50.400 --> 03:52.120
This business is
literally a money spinner.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.120
Soon

03:52.840 --> 03:55.400
[a smuggling activity against
the government's maritime trade ban.]

03:53.150 --> 03:54.610
you'll make enough money.

03:54.870 --> 03:57.240
No... No way, Mr. Wu.

03:57.840 --> 04:00.040
Doing foreign trade is a capital crime.

04:00.150 --> 04:01.240
Mr. Tian,

04:01.750 --> 04:04.280
nothing ventured, nothing gained.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.910
The Directorate of Imperial Supplies

04:05.910 --> 04:07.630
has particularly lucrative posts.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.430
Besides,

04:08.800 --> 04:10.030
my father and I

04:10.360 --> 04:11.560
have got your back.

04:12.030 --> 04:13.430
What are you afraid of?

04:16.829 --> 04:18.720
This is still a serious matter.

04:19.720 --> 04:20.980
Mr. Wu, please allow me

04:21.390 --> 04:22.920
to go back and think it over.

04:30.240 --> 04:32.170
You can make ink for foreign trade.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.120
This is literally a money spinner.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.480
What are you afraid of?

04:38.240 --> 04:39.940
Now that you already know about this,

04:39.940 --> 04:41.800
do you think you can stay out of it?

04:42.360 --> 04:44.159
If you spread the word,

04:44.390 --> 04:46.320
what do you think will happen to me?

04:47.240 --> 04:49.040
Mr. Wu, rest assured.

04:49.680 --> 04:50.430
I won't

04:50.510 --> 04:52.600
breathe a word about this to anyone.

04:52.800 --> 04:53.480
Mr. Wu...

04:54.360 --> 04:55.800
Only your death

04:56.190 --> 04:57.720
can truly put my mind at ease.

04:57.720 --> 04:58.310
Mr. Wu!

04:58.360 --> 04:58.920
Mr. Wu!

04:59.070 --> 04:59.750
Mr. Wu!

05:52.800 --> 05:53.480
Mr. Wu,

05:54.480 --> 05:56.409
I am willing to risk my life on this.

05:56.630 --> 05:57.870
If you really fulfill my wish,

05:57.870 --> 05:59.470
I will repay you handsomely.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.600
That's the spirit.

06:04.160 --> 06:04.950
Don't worry.

06:05.270 --> 06:06.160
Just

06:06.390 --> 06:07.560
leave it to me.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.120
Mr. Wu,

06:21.720 --> 06:22.630
what happened?

06:24.560 --> 06:26.070
You've been tailed.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.920
That merchant, Qi Jiu, is

06:28.160 --> 06:29.970
still creeping behind you.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.130
I'm afraid he's also the one

06:34.430 --> 06:36.760
stirring up trouble on Eunuch Chen's end.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.440
I have a question, Mr. Wu.

06:42.680 --> 06:44.210
In a city as huge as Nanjing,

06:44.600 --> 06:45.510
is it hard to make

06:45.510 --> 06:47.480
a person vanish without a trace

06:48.430 --> 06:49.070
for good?

06:52.120 --> 06:53.800
You mean...

06:57.510 --> 06:58.600
It's easy.

06:59.120 --> 07:01.000
My men can handle it.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.390
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

07:04.070 --> 07:05.070
No problem.

07:11.480 --> 07:19.500
[Yongtong Post Office]

07:24.480 --> 07:25.190
Sir,

07:25.630 --> 07:27.030
I'd like to send a letter.

07:28.430 --> 07:30.270
We can't send anything
to Huizhou right now.

07:30.270 --> 07:32.000
There's been a blizzard for days.

07:32.000 --> 07:33.920
All the roads are completely blocked.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.120
Completely blocked?

07:36.120 --> 07:36.950
Then,

07:37.560 --> 07:39.020
when will the roads clear?

07:40.480 --> 07:41.600
It is hard

07:41.600 --> 07:42.800
to tell right now.

07:42.830 --> 07:43.800
People inside can't get out,

07:43.800 --> 07:45.240
and people outside can't get in.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.510
Look, just these letters here.

07:46.510 --> 07:48.120
They were all meant to be sent
to Huizhou in the past few days.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.950
Yet they're all still sitting here, huh?

07:49.950 --> 07:51.120
And those packages,

07:51.310 --> 07:52.560
they made it halfway,

07:52.800 --> 07:54.390
but got stuck in the snow
for over 10 days.

07:54.390 --> 07:56.120
They simply can't get through.

07:57.800 --> 07:58.600
Thank you.

08:06.540 --> 08:08.420
[He Garden, Huizhou]

08:18.220 --> 08:22.680
[Yihousheng, Huizhou]

08:28.390 --> 08:28.950
A while back,

08:28.950 --> 08:31.610
I sent a lot of Nanjing specialties
to my family.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.909
I also sent one to you.

08:34.390 --> 08:35.450
Did you receive it?

08:36.960 --> 08:37.549
No.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.960
I've been away from Huizhou for days.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.960
I didn't receive it.

09:11.870 --> 09:12.630
Sir,

09:13.080 --> 09:14.120
may I ask

09:14.150 --> 09:16.390
how many goods are sent to Yihousheng

09:16.480 --> 09:17.750
and the New Li Ink Workshop?

09:17.750 --> 09:18.960
About 5 or 6.

09:23.270 --> 09:25.010
[To Old Madam Wang Rujun,
She County, Huizhou]

09:25.510 --> 09:26.150
Sir,

09:26.360 --> 09:27.790
can you give this letter

09:27.790 --> 09:28.910
and those goods to me?

09:28.910 --> 09:30.370
A friend of mine sent them.

09:30.390 --> 09:31.590
She is very homesick.

09:31.750 --> 09:32.960
How about this?

09:33.030 --> 09:34.960
You give me the goods and the letter.

09:34.960 --> 09:35.760
For the goods,

09:35.840 --> 09:36.750
I'll ship them.

09:36.920 --> 09:39.250
And for the letter,
I'll send it by pigeon.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.150
That won't do.

09:41.220 --> 09:42.620
Your name isn't on them.

09:42.650 --> 09:44.310
I can't just let you take them.

09:45.080 --> 09:47.240
Is the person
who sent the letter and goods

09:47.240 --> 09:48.790
a woman named Li Zhen?

09:50.080 --> 09:50.720
No.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.240
No?

09:55.390 --> 09:56.270
Is it a man

09:56.600 --> 09:58.030
named Li Zhengshen?

09:59.020 --> 10:00.630
Yes, his name is Li Zhengshen.

10:00.630 --> 10:02.390
See? I told you I knew him.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.370
How about this?

10:03.480 --> 10:05.670
If you don't trust it,
I can bring the carrier pigeon here

10:05.670 --> 10:07.750
and send it off right in front of you.

10:08.440 --> 10:09.670
Wait for me. I'll be right back.

10:09.670 --> 10:10.240
Well...

10:16.030 --> 10:18.030
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.340
Keep eating up.

10:25.670 --> 10:27.000
Come on, have some more.

10:27.150 --> 10:27.960
Thank you.

10:33.790 --> 10:36.670
The food in Nanjing is indeed exquisite.

10:36.760 --> 10:37.910
But after eating too much,

10:37.910 --> 10:39.840
it feels a bit too sweet and greasy.

10:40.200 --> 10:43.150
It actually makes me miss
the goodies in Huizhou.

10:44.440 --> 10:45.440
Me, too.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.490
I miss my mother's cooking.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.840
I miss her home-made chicken soup

10:50.960 --> 10:52.510
and guozi (a kind of pastry).

10:52.510 --> 10:54.000
I wish my mother were here.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.420
We've been out for so long.

10:59.910 --> 11:01.370
Let me play a game with you.

11:01.670 --> 11:03.440
First, think of a snack in your mind,

11:03.440 --> 11:05.870
your favorite snack from Huizhou.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.000
Let's see...

11:17.910 --> 11:19.510
if it's this one.

11:21.580 --> 11:22.340
Guozi?

11:22.360 --> 11:23.360
Stone Guozi?

11:23.880 --> 11:25.880
This is called "Wishes Come True".

11:25.910 --> 11:27.510
Come on, hurry,
try them while they're hot.

11:27.510 --> 11:28.390
Be careful. It's hot.

11:28.390 --> 11:30.000
Why did you bring it out just now?

11:30.000 --> 11:31.750
To give you a surprise. Here.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.600
Stone Guozi.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.200
Filling our stomachs

11:40.790 --> 11:42.080
will also keep us warm.

11:42.730 --> 11:44.090
You're not from here.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.850
How did you know we locals would

11:45.960 --> 11:48.620
take Stone Guozi
as dry rations when traveling?

11:49.150 --> 11:51.480
I'm just following the local customs.

12:01.150 --> 12:01.870
Zhen.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.270
What's wrong?

12:07.870 --> 12:08.750
Nothing.

12:09.750 --> 12:11.080
Just feeling homesick.

12:14.550 --> 12:15.630
Then eat more.

12:15.960 --> 12:17.890
You won't miss home if you're full.

12:22.480 --> 12:24.410
Come on, Zhengyou, have some fish.

13:00.910 --> 13:02.240
Someone is attacking people in the street!

13:02.240 --> 13:03.900
Go report it to the officials!

13:20.220 --> 13:23.860
[Yongtong Post Office]

13:23.790 --> 13:25.630
Sir, this is to be sent to my home.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.760
Please expedite it.

13:33.790 --> 13:35.720
Sir, please.

13:37.550 --> 13:38.200
Okay.

13:42.000 --> 13:42.750
Master,

13:43.440 --> 13:45.100
did you see clearly who did it?

13:45.840 --> 13:47.030
I don't recognize them.

13:47.030 --> 13:48.090
Unfamiliar faces.

13:48.980 --> 13:50.510
But they came prepared.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.870
However, I can probably guess

13:55.240 --> 13:56.320
who is behind this.

14:01.270 --> 14:03.510
What has Tian Benchang been doing lately?

14:03.510 --> 14:05.930
He still hangs out
with those rich wastrels all day.

14:05.930 --> 14:07.720
I cut off his path
to buying an official title

14:07.720 --> 14:10.480
and blocked Wu Weishi's way
of raking in money.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.440
It's understandable

14:13.270 --> 14:14.600
that they want revenge.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.250
But since Tian Benchang is still
staying in Nanjing,

14:20.180 --> 14:21.650
he must have a backup plan.

14:26.320 --> 14:27.120
Xiao Qi.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.270
Yes, Master.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.670
You stay in Nanjing

14:30.510 --> 14:32.970
and keep an eye on his movements
at all times.

14:33.200 --> 14:34.030
Yes, Master.

14:50.350 --> 14:59.590
[Spring and Autumn Residence]

15:01.750 --> 15:03.080
So you're finally home.

15:07.360 --> 15:09.120
Since you claimed

15:09.510 --> 15:11.390
that you were planning
for the Tian family's future,

15:11.390 --> 15:13.240
why didn't you even show your face

15:13.240 --> 15:15.000
when the Princess's household was
selecting ink?

15:15.000 --> 15:15.960
Do you still consider yourself

15:15.960 --> 15:17.390
the manager of Tian Ink?

15:19.360 --> 15:20.240
You're the useless one

15:20.240 --> 15:23.000
who failed to be the Ink Supplier
to the Princess's household.

15:23.000 --> 15:24.630
Now you're blaming me?

15:25.000 --> 15:26.060
And you're useful?

15:27.080 --> 15:28.870
I targeted the Ink Supplier position
of the Princess's household

15:28.870 --> 15:29.910
because it could free the Tian family

15:29.910 --> 15:31.510
from the influence of others

15:31.510 --> 15:33.770
and lead us to a broader, righteous path.

15:33.870 --> 15:34.960
But look at you,

15:35.210 --> 15:37.540
drinking and gambling
with those wastrels all day long,

15:37.540 --> 15:38.790
living a life of debauchery.

15:38.790 --> 15:40.550
With a manager like you,

15:41.150 --> 15:42.950
the Tian family is truly cursed.

15:43.200 --> 15:44.270
What do you know?

15:44.960 --> 15:47.790
It's not your place to lecture me
in the Tian family.

15:47.790 --> 15:51.520
Don't think you can boss me around
just because you have some power.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.800
To be honest with you,

15:53.630 --> 15:56.890
I have zero interest in being
the Princess's Ink Supplier.

15:57.670 --> 15:58.840
I came to Nanjing

15:59.320 --> 16:03.250
to seek an official position
in the Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

16:03.870 --> 16:06.360
From the Luo family to Qing He and Xu Wan,

16:06.870 --> 16:08.530
these so-called dignitaries

16:08.600 --> 16:10.670
all flatter the high and trample the low
with no exception.

16:10.670 --> 16:13.120
Once they have power, they bully the weak.

16:14.000 --> 16:16.120
To make the Tian family invincible,

16:16.720 --> 16:18.270
we must shed the merchant reputation

16:18.270 --> 16:20.270
and hold power firmly in our own hands.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.790
A position
in the Directorate of Imperial Supplies?

16:21.790 --> 16:22.910
Tian Benchang, you...

16:22.910 --> 16:24.270
Are you crazy?

16:24.530 --> 16:26.440
Do you know how much silver that costs?

16:26.440 --> 16:29.150
Even emptying the Tian family's treasury
won't be enough.

16:29.150 --> 16:30.720
I'm telling you, this won't work.

16:30.720 --> 16:31.750
Even selling me wouldn't cover the cost.

16:31.750 --> 16:33.080
Stay out of my business.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.790
I have my own plans.

16:35.960 --> 16:37.870
Go back to the Capital tomorrow

16:38.030 --> 16:40.440
and keep Sage Qing He
and Aunt Wan company.

16:44.550 --> 16:45.600
Tian Ronghua,

16:46.910 --> 16:48.640
you're nothing more than a tool

16:49.390 --> 16:51.120
for flattering higher-ups.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.670
Good-for-nothing.

17:11.349 --> 17:12.160
My Lady.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.609
Here is your letter.

17:24.329 --> 17:25.460
Get in quickly.

17:25.640 --> 17:27.170
The ship won't wait for you.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.270
Send her to the pier.

17:35.270 --> 17:36.000
Yes, Master.

17:48.720 --> 17:49.750
I hereby appoint

17:50.200 --> 17:53.920
Tian Ronghua as the accountant
of the New Li Ink Workshop in Huizhou.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.960
The term is to be decided
by Tian Ronghua herself,

17:57.110 --> 17:59.550
starting anytime, never to be terminated.

18:00.030 --> 18:01.000
Looking forward to your return.

18:01.000 --> 18:01.830
By Li Zhen.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.350
Father.

18:11.310 --> 18:12.160
Aunt.

18:13.750 --> 18:14.640
Brother.

18:17.350 --> 18:18.890
I have never forgotten

18:20.240 --> 18:22.160
the Luo family's feud.

18:25.790 --> 18:27.000
But right now,

18:29.030 --> 18:31.920
I really want to tell her
my true feelings.

18:37.480 --> 18:40.000
If you allow me to take a step forward,

18:41.720 --> 18:43.320
please let this candle flame

18:44.640 --> 18:45.790
flicker.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.440
Mr. Qi.

19:08.830 --> 19:09.590
Master.

19:14.030 --> 19:15.920
Cause and effect in this world are

19:16.230 --> 19:17.830
not that simple.

19:18.750 --> 19:20.790
Buddha says all things

19:20.830 --> 19:22.760
arise from causes and conditions.

19:23.550 --> 19:25.750
That means in every instant,

19:26.070 --> 19:29.310
cause and effect are ever-changing.

19:30.400 --> 19:31.930
Fate is like flowing water.

19:32.270 --> 19:33.670
It has neither beginning

19:33.680 --> 19:35.030
nor end.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.350
Mr. Qi,

19:38.440 --> 19:40.200
if you don't know how to decide,

19:40.640 --> 19:43.480
why not tell me about it?

19:44.750 --> 19:47.310
Since you feel like it,

19:48.070 --> 19:51.400
why try to cut the water with a knife?

19:57.750 --> 19:58.920
Master Fahui.

20:00.510 --> 20:01.880
I indeed harbor

20:04.790 --> 20:07.070
a very important secret.

20:10.200 --> 20:11.590
But at this very moment,

20:12.750 --> 20:14.350
I met someone who cares for me

20:15.590 --> 20:16.590
and thinks of me.

20:19.960 --> 20:22.590
But I'm well aware
that I am not worthy of her.

20:24.640 --> 20:26.110
I don't want to hurt her,

20:27.790 --> 20:29.390
nor do I want to hold her back.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.070
You are kind

20:32.510 --> 20:33.720
but also greedy.

20:34.510 --> 20:36.110
You want to keep your secret

20:36.200 --> 20:37.830
and fix past regrets,

20:38.400 --> 20:41.000
while also craving a happy future life.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.830
Mr. Qi,

20:43.440 --> 20:45.400
please remember this—

20:45.680 --> 20:47.070
the past feelings

20:47.880 --> 20:49.160
are beyond your grasp.

20:49.880 --> 20:50.960
Why not

20:51.110 --> 20:53.030
take a leap bravely?

20:56.200 --> 20:57.310
Why not...

20:58.720 --> 21:00.070
take a leap bravely?

21:04.920 --> 21:06.000
Farewell.

21:07.790 --> 21:10.190
Thank you for your enlightenment, Master.

21:17.680 --> 21:18.640
Why not...

21:20.110 --> 21:21.510
take a leap bravely?

21:38.680 --> 21:40.480
Why not take a leap bravely?

21:56.440 --> 21:57.350
Sir.

21:58.270 --> 21:59.160
Sir,

21:59.310 --> 22:00.550
about a month ago,

22:00.550 --> 22:02.240
I sent my cousin here

22:02.240 --> 22:03.510
to mail a family letter

22:03.510 --> 22:04.680
and some packages

22:04.920 --> 22:06.030
to Huizhou.

22:06.070 --> 22:07.200
Do you remember?

22:08.350 --> 22:09.240
I remember.

22:09.950 --> 22:11.100
I heard

22:11.120 --> 22:13.270
it snowed heavily in Huizhou a while back,

22:13.270 --> 22:14.240
and the roads were cut off.

22:14.240 --> 22:15.440
So I am a bit worried.

22:15.440 --> 22:16.510
I wonder if those things were

22:16.510 --> 22:17.720
delivered or not.

22:18.400 --> 22:19.030
Miss,

22:19.070 --> 22:21.350
your family letter has already been sent.

22:21.350 --> 22:23.350
As for the packages,
they were shipped by water.

22:23.350 --> 22:25.810
They should arrive in Huizhou
in a day or two.

22:26.110 --> 22:26.790
Miss,

22:26.960 --> 22:29.310
you should really
thank that friend of yours.

22:29.310 --> 22:31.310
He happened to be sending a letter
to Huizhou as well.

22:31.310 --> 22:32.550
So he sent your letter along with his

22:32.550 --> 22:34.640
by carrier pigeon.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.790
As for those packages,

22:37.030 --> 22:38.480
they were also delivered

22:38.480 --> 22:39.810
by the boat he arranged.

22:40.200 --> 22:41.160
However,

22:41.270 --> 22:43.590
he came with some injuries that day.

22:43.750 --> 22:45.280
I don't know what happened.

22:45.590 --> 22:46.750
My friend?

22:47.070 --> 22:48.720
It's a tall one

22:48.720 --> 22:50.580
with thick eyebrows and big eyes.

22:52.590 --> 22:55.110
He... He was injured that day?

22:56.200 --> 22:57.680
What happened?

22:57.720 --> 22:59.000
Was he badly hurt?

23:00.030 --> 23:01.720
It seemed quite serious.

23:01.750 --> 23:03.110
His hands were covered in blood.

23:03.110 --> 23:04.310
As for how he got hurt,

23:04.350 --> 23:05.550
I really have no idea.

23:05.680 --> 23:07.640
He watched the carrier pigeon
fly away that day,

23:07.640 --> 23:08.570
and then he left.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.790
Thank you.

23:12.240 --> 23:13.170
You're welcome.

23:13.440 --> 23:15.110
Did he say anything else?

23:15.960 --> 23:16.680
No.

23:52.590 --> 23:53.750
Zhengshen, take this.

23:53.750 --> 23:54.920
Put it here. Here.

23:58.920 --> 24:00.110
Zhengyou, Zhengyou, Zhengyou.

24:00.110 --> 24:01.270
Help me hold this... this one.

24:01.270 --> 24:02.070
Yes, this one.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.830
Nice. My fingers were about to break.

24:03.830 --> 24:04.720
Zhengshen.

24:05.750 --> 24:06.920
Xianglan bosses you around,

24:06.920 --> 24:08.180
and you boss me around.

24:08.400 --> 24:09.830
You get the girl,

24:09.830 --> 24:11.360
but what do I get out of this?

24:11.480 --> 24:12.510
Don't... don't talk nonsense.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.480
Follow Xianglan

24:13.480 --> 24:15.210
and see what else she's buying.

24:15.790 --> 24:16.790
I don't want this.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.550
Have a good day.

24:21.000 --> 24:21.920
Zhen?

24:23.030 --> 24:23.880
Zhen!

24:24.000 --> 24:24.790
Zhen!

24:25.350 --> 24:26.200
Hello, Zhen.

24:26.400 --> 24:27.240
Zhen!

24:27.680 --> 24:27.830
Zhen.

24:27.830 --> 24:28.680
Why are you...

24:28.750 --> 24:31.010
Why are you wandering around here alone?

24:31.680 --> 24:32.590
Xianglan,

24:32.880 --> 24:34.270
You almost bought

24:34.270 --> 24:35.670
half of Nanjing, I think.

24:36.550 --> 24:38.110
I rarely have a chance to come out.

24:38.110 --> 24:39.590
I must shop to my heart's content.

24:39.590 --> 24:41.190
As long as Xianglan likes it.

24:43.810 --> 24:44.410
By the way,

24:44.720 --> 24:45.590
today is

24:45.590 --> 24:47.880
the biannual
Sanshan Hall Lantern Festival.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.640
Let's hurry home and get ready

24:49.830 --> 24:51.510
to see the lanterns tonight.

24:51.590 --> 24:52.640
Come on! Let's go!

24:55.160 --> 24:56.480
Xianglan, wait for me!

25:28.390 --> 25:32.340
♪ Rain is the burden
clouds can no longer bear ♪

25:32.360 --> 25:36.580
♪ Falling where love and hate intertwine ♪

25:38.010 --> 25:42.100
♪ I can't rid myself of this hatred ♪

25:42.120 --> 25:46.850
♪ It neither fades nor remains hidden ♪

25:47.550 --> 25:51.680
♪ Regret is a wound time cannot heal ♪

25:51.700 --> 25:56.230
♪ Once aflame, now chilled ♪

25:57.090 --> 26:01.340
♪ You're the unreachable love I pursue ♪

26:01.370 --> 26:07.210
♪ I long for you in my heart,
yet I dare not forget you ♪

26:07.510 --> 26:14.000
♪ Who's to blame, and who remains caught
in endless cycles of love and hate? ♪

26:14.030 --> 26:17.170
♪ I have no regrets about this hatred ♪

26:17.260 --> 26:23.400
♪ As close as kin,
yet as distant as strangers ♪

26:23.510 --> 26:26.580
♪ Who bears the guilt in love? ♪

26:26.800 --> 26:33.180
♪ We cast love aside,
leaving our hearts in pieces ♪

26:33.200 --> 26:36.880
♪ Is it wrong or right? ♪

26:37.410 --> 26:40.130
♪ Standing at opposite ends ♪

26:40.160 --> 26:45.100
♪ We can only face each other in silence ♪

27:09.160 --> 27:13.110
♪ Rain is the burden
clouds can no longer bear ♪

27:13.130 --> 27:17.350
♪ Falling where love and hate intertwine ♪

27:18.860 --> 27:22.950
♪ I can't rid myself of this hatred ♪

27:22.980 --> 27:27.700
♪ It neither fades nor remains hidden ♪

27:28.320 --> 27:32.450
♪ Regret is a wound time cannot heal ♪

27:32.480 --> 27:37.000
♪ Once aflame, now chilled ♪

27:37.870 --> 27:42.120
♪ You're the unreachable love I pursue ♪

27:42.140 --> 27:47.980
♪ I long for you in my heart,
yet I dare not forget you ♪

27:48.370 --> 27:54.610
♪ Who's sober, who's drunk, and who
holds back from trying to mend it? ♪

27:54.750 --> 27:57.900
♪ Reason forces us back ♪

27:58.060 --> 28:04.320
♪ When defenses fall,
who is left more broken? ♪

28:04.340 --> 28:07.680
♪ Why keep chasing it? ♪

28:07.700 --> 28:13.820
♪ Half bright, half dim—
an unfinished, imperfect kind of beauty ♪

28:10.070 --> 28:10.880
Does it hurt?

28:13.940 --> 28:18.010
♪ How should we end this? ♪

28:14.070 --> 28:14.880
No.

28:18.030 --> 28:21.470
♪ I stare through hope and drifting haze,
tears in my eyes ♪

28:21.840 --> 28:25.920
♪ Lost and unsure where to go ♪

28:22.680 --> 28:24.070
You're hurt so badly.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.520
What exactly happened that day?

28:27.660 --> 28:31.480
♪ I stare through hope and drifting haze,
tears in my eyes ♪

28:30.880 --> 28:32.000
That doesn't matter.

28:31.500 --> 28:37.920
♪ Lost and unsure where to go ♪

28:37.480 --> 28:38.310
Qi Jiu.

28:40.270 --> 28:41.670
Since we parted that day,

28:43.240 --> 28:44.550
I've thought a lot.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.960
I've figured it out.

28:50.240 --> 28:51.840
I have something to tell you.

28:55.110 --> 28:56.920
I know you have a secret,

28:57.720 --> 28:59.780
and this secret is so important to you

29:00.030 --> 29:02.030
that you can't talk about it easily.

29:03.480 --> 29:05.080
I've thought it all through.

29:05.590 --> 29:07.030
I will no longer force you

29:07.200 --> 29:08.960
to tell me everything.

29:09.030 --> 29:10.480
But I have one request.

29:11.510 --> 29:13.310
From now on, wherever you are,

29:13.720 --> 29:16.320
whatever you do,
you must take care of yourself

29:16.640 --> 29:18.370
and not put yourself in danger.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.240
Qi Jiu,

29:21.510 --> 29:23.440
I want to go back to how we used to be,

29:24.480 --> 29:26.610
doing Harvest Eve Foraging together,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.680
enjoying Stone Guozi together,

29:29.440 --> 29:32.100
and watching that pine tree
grow tall together.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.920
You truly

29:41.480 --> 29:43.000
mean a lot to me.

29:45.830 --> 29:47.720
I don't want to lose you again.

30:11.000 --> 30:11.920
Zhen,

30:14.350 --> 30:16.480
why are you so good?

30:17.920 --> 30:18.880
Our meeting

30:22.790 --> 30:24.590
It's a great blessing in my life.

30:29.200 --> 30:31.860
I don't want to hide
my feelings for you anymore.

30:34.480 --> 30:36.350
You have always been in my heart.

30:38.400 --> 30:39.930
I have never forgotten you.

30:50.640 --> 30:51.440
Don't cry.

30:56.720 --> 30:57.510
Don't cry.

31:00.000 --> 31:00.830
Don't cry.

31:05.160 --> 31:05.960
Zhen.

31:09.480 --> 31:11.540
About the secret you just mentioned,

31:13.830 --> 31:15.000
I won't deny it.

31:16.810 --> 31:17.830
That secret was

31:19.590 --> 31:21.400
the only motivation

31:23.110 --> 31:25.880
keeping me alive before I met you.

31:31.270 --> 31:32.240
Don't worry,

31:33.510 --> 31:36.510
I will definitely confess
this secret to you.

31:37.960 --> 31:40.240
But please give me a little more time.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.480
I believe...

31:44.450 --> 31:45.740
I believe it will be soon.

31:44.470 --> 31:49.780
♪ Candlelight sways,
I swallow sorrow alone ♪

31:46.680 --> 31:47.480
Soon.

31:50.030 --> 31:50.880
When that time comes,

31:50.880 --> 31:53.000
I will surely be with you

31:53.210 --> 31:58.620
♪ I write each word in slow,
desolate tone ♪

31:53.920 --> 31:55.440
openly, honestly,

31:56.880 --> 31:57.960
wholeheartedly,

31:58.790 --> 32:00.110
and properly.

32:01.020 --> 32:05.390
♪ Looking back,
the road stretches on and on ♪

32:01.030 --> 32:02.490
You don't need to say more.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.730
I believe everything you say.

32:05.750 --> 32:10.030
♪ Still unhurt,
I drink another grief with the moon ♪

32:06.590 --> 32:07.880
Then it's a promise.

32:08.640 --> 32:10.750
From now on, you can't push me away again.

32:10.240 --> 32:17.780
♪ I carve past years' bonds
into the scroll of time ♪

32:13.110 --> 32:14.480
From this moment on,

32:15.960 --> 32:17.960
we will love and cherish each other,

32:18.260 --> 32:22.520
♪ Please turn the light
that waits in the dark ♪

32:20.310 --> 32:21.480
never to be apart.

32:22.670 --> 32:26.530
♪ Into a new direction
after wind and frost ♪

32:27.130 --> 32:31.160
♪ Trust keeps the heart calm ♪

32:31.660 --> 32:35.530
♪ And unconfused ♪

32:35.850 --> 32:40.270
♪ Please let the girl I might meet again ♪

32:40.630 --> 32:44.770
♪ Be hope that fate has gently given ♪

32:45.010 --> 32:48.530
♪ No matter how many regrets remain ♪

32:49.480 --> 32:52.160
♪ In the end, all has already passed ♪

33:26.000 --> 33:26.720
Okay.

33:26.830 --> 33:28.830
One copy of the deed for each of us.

33:28.920 --> 33:29.980
This one is for you.

33:30.680 --> 33:33.030
Miss Li Zhen, you're really meticulous.

33:33.560 --> 33:35.800
I'm leaving this shop to you from now on.

33:35.830 --> 33:36.920
Yes. Don't worry.

33:36.920 --> 33:38.680
I'll take my leave then.

33:43.680 --> 33:44.680
Zhengshen,

33:44.720 --> 33:46.720
the more I look at this shop,
the more I like it.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.310
The location and size are perfect.

33:48.310 --> 33:49.400
When we open,

33:49.400 --> 33:51.070
business will surely be booming.

33:51.070 --> 33:52.480
I've posted the recruitment notice.

33:52.480 --> 33:54.510
I also asked my father
to prepare the ink supplies.

33:54.510 --> 33:56.480
I think we can open for business

33:56.480 --> 33:57.400
in 10 to 15 days.

33:59.030 --> 34:01.640
But before we find a reliable manager,

34:01.680 --> 34:02.590
you still need

34:02.590 --> 34:04.120
to keep an eye on this place.

34:04.350 --> 34:05.650
Rest assured, Manager Zhen.

34:05.650 --> 34:08.050
I will definitely take care of everything.

34:09.590 --> 34:10.790
Put this away safely.

34:15.110 --> 34:15.840
Is this okay?

34:18.230 --> 34:19.590
Move the stuff. Come on.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.840
Tell me how to load it.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.800
Put the ones with flowers there.

34:21.800 --> 34:22.360
Okay.

34:23.320 --> 34:24.780
Zhengyou, give them to me.

34:29.000 --> 34:30.150
Mr. Xiao,

34:30.230 --> 34:32.750
look at how this woman spends money.
It's insane.

34:32.750 --> 34:34.630
We know she's bought gifts for home,

34:34.630 --> 34:35.550
but those who don't know

34:35.550 --> 34:37.710
would think she's moving
Nanjing City back with her.

34:37.710 --> 34:39.639
Food and daily items are one thing,

34:40.040 --> 34:40.920
but cold medicine?

34:40.920 --> 34:42.980
Can you believe she prepared 2 boxes?

34:45.159 --> 34:47.360
We're taking the boat
back to Huizhou tomorrow.

34:47.360 --> 34:49.510
During this long journey
with changing weather,

34:49.510 --> 34:51.190
it's easy to catch a cold.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.590
Of course, we need to prepare

34:52.590 --> 34:54.000
this cure-all for colds,

34:54.030 --> 34:55.440
just in case.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.030
Yes, yes.

34:57.030 --> 34:58.590
Miss Yan, you're so right.

34:58.880 --> 35:00.230
The med's name, Ganfengling, is

35:00.230 --> 35:01.550
also a very good omen.

35:01.590 --> 35:02.590
"Ling" means

35:02.590 --> 35:03.800
great fortune,

35:03.800 --> 35:04.960
brilliant blessings,

35:04.960 --> 35:06.690
and good luck with everything.

35:07.400 --> 35:08.860
And "feng" for safe trips.

35:11.630 --> 35:12.440
Xianglan,

35:12.840 --> 35:14.550
after you return to Huizhou,

35:15.110 --> 35:16.590
can I write to you?

35:20.000 --> 35:22.230
Miss Xiaotao, what brings you here?

35:22.880 --> 35:24.410
Good morning, Miss Li Zhen.

35:25.000 --> 35:25.800
After the Princess

35:25.800 --> 35:28.360
presented the birthday inkstick
to the Noble Consort,

35:28.360 --> 35:31.190
she was always in high spirits
before every visit to the imperial palace.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.630
And when she returned,

35:32.670 --> 35:34.480
she couldn't stop talking about the fun

35:34.480 --> 35:36.760
of practicing calligraphy and painting
with the Noble Consort.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.710
The Princess sent me here specifically

35:38.710 --> 35:40.110
to convey her gratitude.

35:40.190 --> 35:41.230
You are too kind.

35:41.280 --> 35:42.940
This is our duty as ink makers.

35:47.360 --> 35:49.550
Here's an edict from Noble Consort Du.

35:53.590 --> 35:57.510
Li Zhen, Li Ink's manager, presented ink
and made a meritorious contribution.

35:57.510 --> 36:01.410
I hereby bestow upon Li Zhen
one stick of Sihe Ink, a treasure

36:01.560 --> 36:03.160
from the palace collection.

36:03.190 --> 36:06.280
The Sihe Ink was made
by the ancestors of the Li family

36:06.280 --> 36:08.840
as the supreme ink product.

36:08.920 --> 36:12.230
I hope the entire Li clan
will take this ink as a model,

36:12.320 --> 36:13.920
remaining diligent and respectful

36:13.920 --> 36:16.510
to recreate the glory of Li Ink.

36:17.710 --> 36:19.170
Thank you, Noble Consort.

36:19.400 --> 36:20.600
Thank you, Princess.

36:28.630 --> 36:30.630
Miss Li Zhen, the gift has been delivered.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.030
We will return to report.

36:32.070 --> 36:33.630
I heard that early tomorrow morning,

36:33.630 --> 36:35.630
you will be setting off for Huizhou.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.840
I wish you a safe and smooth journey.

36:38.760 --> 36:39.550
Farewell.

36:40.360 --> 36:42.150
Thank you, Miss Xiaotao.

36:50.280 --> 36:51.340
Congratulations.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.560
It's our Li family's...

37:01.560 --> 37:03.940
[Sihe Ink]

37:16.870 --> 37:20.610
[Huizhou]

37:30.880 --> 37:32.340
-Aunt Rujun.
-Aunt Rujun.

37:32.800 --> 37:34.400
It's freezing cold out here.

37:34.420 --> 37:35.730
Why did you come?

37:35.760 --> 37:37.220
Your health matters most.

37:37.360 --> 37:38.360
Yes, Aunt Rujun.

37:38.510 --> 37:40.350
It will take Zhen a while to arrive.

37:40.350 --> 37:41.650
Please rest on the shore for a bit.

37:41.650 --> 37:42.820
Don't catch a chill.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.550
It's okay. I'm fine.

37:44.550 --> 37:47.150
My mother
insisted on picking up Zhen herself.

37:47.230 --> 37:49.070
Don't worry, it's fine.

37:56.320 --> 37:58.280
My little Zhen

37:59.230 --> 38:02.630
hadn't left Huizhou since she was little.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.740
Yet she's been gone for so long this time.

38:05.960 --> 38:07.480
She must be

38:08.280 --> 38:11.070
feeling restless.

38:12.360 --> 38:13.280
So,

38:13.800 --> 38:15.840
I want the whole family

38:15.920 --> 38:18.920
to be here, all together,

38:19.110 --> 38:20.360
to welcome her.

38:20.670 --> 38:24.190
So she can see us
as soon as she gets off the boat

38:24.280 --> 38:25.920
and know that we are

38:26.480 --> 38:27.920
all waiting for her.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.320
Okay.

38:29.710 --> 38:32.440
Our whole family
will welcome her home together.

38:32.550 --> 38:33.590
Good.

38:34.190 --> 38:35.400
Are you cold?

38:35.670 --> 38:36.710
Not anymore.

38:50.960 --> 38:51.880
Zhen,

38:52.480 --> 38:54.280
how much longer until we arrive?

38:55.760 --> 38:57.360
Are you homesick, Zhengyou?

38:58.630 --> 39:00.830
I miss the Sesame Guozi Mother makes me.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.840
I miss Grandmother, too.

39:04.070 --> 39:05.550
We'll be home soon.

39:05.590 --> 39:08.590
Then you can see your mother
and Seventh Grandmother.

39:23.920 --> 39:25.800
Zhen, look.

39:26.070 --> 39:28.400
At the dock are my mother, Second Aunt,

39:28.590 --> 39:30.360
Third Uncle, and Third Aunt.

39:31.510 --> 39:32.320
And...

39:33.670 --> 39:35.400
That's Grandmother!

39:36.320 --> 39:38.380
Grandmother came to welcome us, too.

39:38.630 --> 39:39.760
Come on, Zhengyou.

39:41.230 --> 39:42.490
Seventh Grandmother!

39:42.630 --> 39:44.070
Seventh Grandmother!

39:45.410 --> 39:46.040
Mother.

39:46.070 --> 39:47.590
Seventh Grandmother!

39:47.800 --> 39:49.280
There comes Zhen's boat.

39:55.400 --> 39:56.320
Zhengyou.

39:58.840 --> 40:00.190
We're home.

40:03.000 --> 40:04.150
We're home.

40:23.840 --> 40:25.100
Seventh Grandmother,

40:25.960 --> 40:27.360
I've returned.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.480
Good to have you back

40:29.800 --> 40:31.360
safe and sound.

40:31.800 --> 40:32.880
Seventh Grandmother,

40:32.880 --> 40:34.440
I fulfilled my mission.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.270
During this trip to Nanjing,

40:36.360 --> 40:39.440
I helped Li Ink win a 3-year ink contract
with the Princess's Mansion.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.480
Besides,

40:40.710 --> 40:42.510
I have brought something back.

40:45.840 --> 40:50.100
Princess Shouyang personally petitioned
His Majesty and the Noble Consort

40:50.230 --> 40:52.630
to gift the last stick of Sihe Ink
from the palace collection

40:52.630 --> 40:53.710
to the Li family.

40:54.190 --> 40:57.110
I brought it back personally.

41:03.440 --> 41:04.840
Stand up, quickly.

41:13.190 --> 41:14.510
There really is

41:15.630 --> 41:18.820
the Sihe Ink
made by our Li family in this world.

41:24.840 --> 41:26.150
Zhen,

41:27.110 --> 41:28.770
you have achieved a great feat

41:29.070 --> 41:31.190
for the Li family.

41:35.070 --> 41:36.320
Since you were the one

41:37.070 --> 41:39.230
who retrieved this Sihe Ink,

41:40.070 --> 41:41.360
it shall be you

41:42.960 --> 41:44.480
personally placing it

41:45.000 --> 41:48.360
into the Li Ink Vault.

42:03.230 --> 42:04.150
Zhen.

42:05.360 --> 42:06.710
Come in with me.

42:08.400 --> 42:10.330
Mother, can you manage on your own?

42:10.880 --> 42:11.840
I can.

42:19.110 --> 42:20.110
Eighth Master Li,

42:20.390 --> 42:23.650
when was the last time
the Ink Vault was opened to store ink?

42:24.190 --> 42:26.790
I remember it was
one or two decades ago, right?

42:27.190 --> 42:28.150
At least.

42:29.880 --> 42:31.670
That was when I was still young,

42:32.550 --> 42:35.110
and my Seventh Brother stored
some ancient ink inside.

42:35.110 --> 42:37.190
This Ink Vault has always been

42:37.190 --> 42:39.650
accessible
only to the Head of the Workshop.

42:40.320 --> 42:41.190
Eighth Uncle,

42:42.040 --> 42:43.440
my mother has been waiting for this day

42:43.440 --> 42:45.070
for many, many years.

42:45.760 --> 42:46.960
Aunt Rujun

42:47.400 --> 42:49.760
has guarded this place
for most of her life.

42:49.760 --> 42:51.710
We, the Sixth and Eighth Branches,

42:51.960 --> 42:53.690
have also wasted half our lives

42:53.920 --> 42:55.580
over what happened back then.

42:56.110 --> 42:57.230
It is time

42:57.590 --> 43:00.190
to let the next generation take the stage.

